# CVE-2026-3449: @tootallnate/once Incorrect Control Flow Scoping
# CVSS 3.3 (Low) | EPSS 0.01%
#
# Suppressed because:
# - Vulnerability only triggers when AbortSignal is passed to once() and aborted
# - This app uses firebase-admin solely for verifyIdToken() in Google Sign-In
# - We don't use @google-cloud/storage or proxy functionality
# - The vulnerable code path is never executed
#
# Fix blocked by: teeny-request pins http-proxy-agent@^5.0.0 which requires @tootallnate/once@2
# Upstream issue: Google's teeny-request hasn't updated to http-proxy-agent v7+
#
# Review periodically: Check if teeny-request updates http-proxy-agent dependency
CVE-2026-3449
